  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "458C47E1C3BE8503",
      "text": "Yo, zukünftiger Champ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "458C48E1C3BE86B6",
      "text": "Sorry, dass du warten musstest. Da bin ich wieder.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "458C49E1C3BE8869",
      "text": "Drei Mitglieder der Top Vier hast du jetzt schon\\nbesiegt. Du machst ja beängstigende Fortschritte![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_a_01",
      "hash64": "3515A0ADCF5388A7",
      "text": "Matt is’ nich’ gerade schwach.\\nNur etwas einfach gestrickt.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_a_02",
      "hash64": "3515A1ADCF538A5A",
      "text": "Aber das mag ich an ihm.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_a_03",
      "hash64": "3515A2ADCF538C0D",
      "text": "Nach der AG saßen wir früher immer zusammen\\nund haben seine Kochkreationen verputzt.\\r\\nDas waren noch Zeiten...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_a_04",
      "hash64": "35159BADCF538028",
      "text": "Selbst ihm scheint die momentane Situation\\nzu schaffen zu machen.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_b_01",
      "hash64": "E1EBC8B7E02DF950",
      "text": "Erin hinterlässt ’nen bleibenden Eindruck, was?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_b_02",
      "hash64": "E1EBCBB7E02DFE69",
      "text": "Sie und Hana scheinen sich überraschend gut\\nzu verstehen.\\c\\nDen beiden beim Quatschen zuzusehen,\\nhat echten Unterhaltungswert, hehe![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_b_03",
      "hash64": "E1EBCAB7E02DFCB6",
      "text": "Erin kommt immer so ernst und spießig rüber,\\ndabei is’ sie in Wirklichkeit sehr sensibel.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_b_04",
      "hash64": "E1EBCDB7E02E01CF",
      "text": "Sie wird schnell missverstanden, aber du weißt ja\\njetz’, was Sache is’, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_c_01",
      "hash64": "0D85D4BE413B4085",
      "text": "Tara liebt einfach alles, was niedlich aussieht,\\nund gerade das scheint der Grund dafür zu sein,\\r\\ndass ihre Pokémon so stark sind.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_c_02",
      "hash64": "0D85D1BE413B3B6C",
      "text": "Sie is’ so vernarrt in ihr Team, dass sich das\\nTraining für sie gar nich’ wie Arbeit anfühlt.\\r\\nSchon krass.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_c_03",
      "hash64": "0D85D2BE413B3D1F",
      "text": "Aber das scheint bei dir ja ähnlich zu sein, oder?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_c_04",
      "hash64": "0D85CFBE413B3806",
      "text": "Davon sollte sich ein gewisser Jemand, der sich\\nund andere opfert, nur um stärker zu werden,\\r\\nmal eine Scheibe abschneiden![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_c_05",
      "hash64": "0D85D0BE413B39B9",
      "text": "Is’ dir übrigens aufgefallen, dass Tara zu allen\\nhöflich is’, nur nich’ zu mir? Frag mich, warum...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_d_01",
      "hash64": "63EB9CC5DCA4FD8E",
      "text": "Dafür kriegste natürlich auch die versprochene\\nBelohnung. Hier![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_d_02",
      "hash64": "63EB9BC5DCA4FBDB",
      "text": "Das bisschen Staub stört dich doch nich’, oder?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "458C4AE1C3BE8A1C",
      "text": "Ein Talent wie dich aus nächster Nähe zu sehen,\\nlässt so schnell niemanden kalt, auch Jo nich’.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "458C4BE1C3BE8BCF",
      "text": "Mal sehen...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_lasta",
      "hash64": "08FA6799065307D3",
      "text": "Wer fehlt dir jetzt noch...? Ach, Matt!\\c\\nDem Hitzkopf verpasst du am besten mit\\nkaltem Wasser eine schöne Abkühlung.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_lastb",
      "hash64": "08FA689906530986",
      "text": "Wer fehlt dir jetzt noch...? Ach, Erin!\\c\\nLass dich von ihrer eisernen Miene nicht irritieren\\nund heiz ihr mit etwas Feuer ordentlich ein.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_lastac",
      "hash64": "9485B905BF161010",
      "text": "Wer fehlt dir jetzt noch...? Ach, Tara!\\c\\nDie is’ ganz schön stark, aber dir wird sie\\nsicher keine Probleme bereiten, [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0403,0000)]BroGirl.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0403",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_lastd",
      "hash64": "08FA6A9906530CEC",
      "text": "Wer fehlt dir jetzt noch...? Ach, meine Wenigkeit!\\nDas Beste kommt zum Schluss, wie?\\c\\nWeil du mich bis zum Ende aufgehoben hast,\\nhatte ich ’ne Menge Zeit, um mich vorzubereiten.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0160_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "458C4CE1C3BE8D82",
      "text": "Also dann, viel Erfolg![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
